    <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
        <div class="card-premium p-3 h-100 d-flex flex-column">
            <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-2">
                <div class="kpi-icon kpi-icon-orange mb-0"><i class="bi bi-stars" aria-hidden="true"></i></div>
                <h5 class="mb-0">AI Features</h5>
            </div>
            <p class="text-secondary small flex-grow-1">Intelligent storage insights powered by machine learning — including anomaly detection, predictive capacity planning, and AI-driven duplicate classification.</p>
            <span class="badge bg-secondary bg-opacity-25 text-secondary align-self-start">Coming soon</span>
